    retired when installers learned to run themselves. He told everyone
    exactly what to do. Everyone clicked Next. In marker, underneath: found
    work, same house as the other two.

// R19 · relations · blue · DRAFT
CODEX No Politics Required
  title: No Politics Required
  category: Facts
  code: NO-POLITICS-HIRE
  text:
    Trabolta made Task Manager, who lost his job to an assistant called
