    so the ground would swallow it on the morning it opened, with the site
    empty. Mayor Randy Barkmore Jr. arrived in his Escalade at 4 a.m., hours
    before anyone would have expected him, dancing to his own speech. The
    sinkhole became the figurehead image of the whole data centre debate,
    and the Halifax Sinkhole Hacker became the tabloid media's number one
    priority. This is far more attention than she ever meant to get. She
    barely leaves the house.

